1.Meets the diagnostic criteria for myasthenia gravis (the diagnostic criteria are based on the 2020 Chinese Society of Immunology, Neuroimmunology Branch: "Chinese Guidelines for the Diagnosis and Treatment of Myasthenia Gravis (2020 Edition)");
